    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11938" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cūpa</span></b> , ae, f.
		cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύπτω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a tub, cask, tun,
			vat</i>, etc., for holding liquids, esp. wine, Varr. ap.
					<i><span class="en">Non. p. 83, 24 sq.</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Pall. 1, 18, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">1, 38,
			1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Pis. 27, 67</span></i> (but acc. to Ernesti,
				<i>a female vintner;</i> cf. copa); Caes. B. C: 2,
			11; <i><span class="en">Luc.
				4, 420</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">also for grain,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					19, 2, 31</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">and for the ashes of the dead,</span>”
				<i>a niche</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 2697</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">4550</span></i>.</div>
